  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (variance) is not explicitly considered or mentioned in the verbal report. The individual discusses certainty and risk of receiving nothing, which relates to risk aversion or expected value, but not variance. The decision reason specifically requires comparing variances and preferring the one with smaller variance (Lottery B). Since the individual does not mention variance or the spread of outcomes, the rule of the decision reason is not applied. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason to make the decision.",
